{
  "title": "Traefik (Ingress)",
  "uid": "homelab-traefik",
  "description": "Der einzige Eingang ins Homelab. Drei Dinge sind an den Queries nicht offensichtlich: (1) Das Traefik-Backend steht im Label exported_service, nicht in service. Prometheus benennt bei einer Kollision das Label des Exporters um, und service ist vom ServiceMonitor belegt. Eine Query auf service matcht deshalb nur den Scrape-Target-Namen traefik-metrics. (2) Alle Counter liegen pro Pod vor, Traefik laeuft mit mehreren Replicas (topologySpreadConstraints wegen externalTrafficPolicy Local). Ohne sum() sieht man nur einen Teil des Verkehrs. (3) Diese Traefik-Version liefert keine traefik_router_*-Metriken, es gibt nur die Entrypoint- und die Service-Ebene. Eine Sicht pro Host ist damit nicht moeglich, exported_service ist der naechstbeste Anker.",
  "tags": ["homelab", "traefik", "ingress"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requests/s",
      "description": "Nur die beiden echten Entrypoints. metrics und traefik (Dashboard) sind absichtlich draussen, sonst zaehlt der eigene Prometheus-Scrape mit.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(traefik_entrypoint_requests_total{entrypoint=~\"web|websecure\"}[5m]))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "decimals": 2, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Fehlerquote 5xx",
      "description": "Anteil der 5xx an allen Requests auf web und websecure. clamp_min haelt den Nenner von der Null weg, sonst zeigt der Wert bei Leerlauf NaN.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(traefik_entrypoint_requests_total{entrypoint=~\"web|websecure\",code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(traefik_entrypoint_requests_total{entrypoint=~\"web|websecure\"}[5m])), 0.0001)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.01 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.05 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p95 Latenz",
      "description": "Entrypoint websecure. Enthaelt die Backend-Zeit, nicht nur Traefik selbst.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(traefik_entrypoint_request_duration_seconds_bucket{entrypoint=\"websecure\"}[5m])))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Offene Verbindungen",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(traefik_open_connections{entrypoint=~\"web|websecure\"})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cert-Restlaufzeit",
      "description": "Das Wildcard-Cert *.elmstreet79.de aus dem TLSStore default, wie Traefik es tatsaechlich ausliefert. Das ist die Gegenprobe zu cert-manager: hier faellt auch auf, wenn erneuert wurde, Traefik aber noch das alte Cert haelt.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 16, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "min(traefik_tls_certs_not_after) - time()",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 604800 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1209600 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Letzter Config-Reload",
      "description": "Alter des letzten erfolgreichen Reloads. Die Metrik ist ein Zeitstempel, kein Erfolgsflag: ein alter Wert heisst nur, dass sich lange nichts geaendert hat, und ist bei einem stabilen Cluster normal.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 20, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "time() - max(traefik_config_last_reload_success)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "s", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests/s pro Entrypoint",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (entrypoint) (rate(traefik_entrypoint_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{entrypoint}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 5, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Statuscode-Klassen",
      "description": "Die Klasse entsteht per label_replace aus dem code-Label, in drei Schritten. Der Zweig fuer code=0 ist kein Fehler: Traefik zaehlt eine Antwort erst, wenn die Verbindung endet, offene WebSockets und Streams (Home Assistant, Plex, UniFi) landen deshalb als 0. Sonstige faengt die einstelligen Codes, die Traefik fuer protocol=grpc meldet (dort ist code der gRPC-Status, nicht der HTTP-Status). Ohne diesen dritten Schritt landen die in einer Serie ohne Namen.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (klasse) (label_replace(label_replace(label_replace(sum by (code) (rate(traefik_entrypoint_requests_total{entrypoint=~\"web|websecure\"}[5m])), \"klasse\", \"${1}xx\", \"code\", \"([0-9])[0-9][0-9]\"), \"klasse\", \"offen\", \"code\", \"0\"), \"klasse\", \"sonstige\", \"klasse\", \"^$\"))",
          "legendFormat": "{{klasse}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 40,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "5xx" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "4xx" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "yellow" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "2xx" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latenz websecure (p50, p95, p99)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(traefik_entrypoint_request_duration_seconds_bucket{entrypoint=\"websecure\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(traefik_entrypoint_request_duration_seconds_bucket{entrypoint=\"websecure\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(traefik_entrypoint_request_duration_seconds_bucket{entrypoint=\"websecure\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Durchsatz",
      "description": "requests_bytes sind die eingehenden, responses_bytes die ausgehenden Nutzdaten der beiden echten Entrypoints.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 12 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(traefik_entrypoint_requests_bytes_total{entrypoint=~\"web|websecure\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "rein"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(traefik_entrypoint_responses_bytes_total{entrypoint=~\"web|websecure\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "raus"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Backends",
      "description": "Ein Eintrag pro Traefik-Service. Die Namen sind die von Traefik generierten: <namespace>-<ingress>-<hash>@kubernetescrd bzw. @kubernetes. Die external-services-Backends (unifi, pve, nas, plex, dreambox) stehen hier gleichberechtigt neben den Cluster-Diensten, weil Traefik beide gleich behandelt.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 12, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (exported_service) (rate(traefik_service_requests_total[5m]))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (exported_service) (rate(traefik_service_requests_total{code=~\"5..\"}[5m]))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (exported_service, le) (rate(traefik_service_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (exported_service) (rate(traefik_service_responses_bytes_total[5m]))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "joinByField", "options": { "byField": "exported_service", "mode": "outer" } },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "Time 1": true, "Time 2": true, "Time 3": true, "Time 4": true },
            "renameByName": {
              "exported_service": "Backend",
              "Value #A": "Requests/s",
              "Value #B": "5xx/s",
              "Value #C": "p95",
              "Value #D": "raus"
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "exported_service": 0,
              "Value #A": 1,
              "Value #B": 2,
              "Value #C": 3,
              "Value #D": 4
            }
          }
        },
        { "id": "sortBy", "options": { "fields": {}, "sort": [{ "field": "Requests/s", "desc": true }] } }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "align": "auto", "cellOptions": { "type": "auto" } },
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 3
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Requests/s" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "unit", "value": "reqps" }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "5xx/s" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "reqps" },
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-text" } },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    { "color": "green", "value": null },
                    { "color": "red", "value": 0.001 }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "p95" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "s" },
              { "id": "decimals", "value": 2 }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "raus" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "Bps" },
              { "id": "decimals", "value": 0 }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "footer": { "show": false, "reducer": ["sum"], "countRows": false, "fields": "" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Top-Backends nach Requests/s",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 32 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "topk(8, sum by (exported_service) (rate(traefik_service_requests_total[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{exported_service}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 5, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    }
  ]
}
